      "created_at": "2015-03-04T20:39:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We're conducting ourselves in a fur-brained manner if we are mashing derailed threads with puns.</p><p>Throwing a hissing fit over twice-baked trains of thought isn't cause for that drastic of measures.</p><p>Puns should be reserved for light and fluffy branch line topics, not just anytime someone gets an itch to pounce on a thread.</p>",
